  * *Cost-Effectiveness:* High; gains GP clinical capacity without proportional staff expansion.
  * *Alignment:* Core pillar of the UK Life Sciences Strategy and NHS Digital Transformation agenda.
  * *Timeline:* Short-term (1–3 years).
  * *Inequalities:* Moderate; benefits practices universally, but digital infrastructure vary.

