* **Implementation Level:** Clinical Level.
* **Mechanism:** Real-time pop-up guidance embedded in EHR consultation windows calculating Centor/McIsaac scores for sore throats or CRB-65 scores for pneumonia, prompting non-prescribing or delayed prescribing options.
